 ### NeRFactor
-A method that starts with a pre-trained NeRF model to recover a relightable model by simplifying the pre-trained NeRF’s volumetric geometry into a surface model [S3, unofficial]. It optimizes MLPs to represent light source visibility and surface normals at any point on the surface, and optimizes a representation of the environment lighting and the BRDF at any surface point [S3, unofficial]. Results in a more efficient rendering model because volumetric geometry is simplified into a single surface and light-source visibility at any point can be computed by a single MLP query [S3, unofficial]. Choose it for efficient relightable model recovery from a pre-trained NeRF.
